WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:13,050
If my results for my cheek swab came back saying my cancer is

00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:20,050
a meadow acid-based, does that mean I should never eat red meat again?

00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:25,050
So we never say that your cancer is a meadow acid-based.

00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:29,050
We might say that we think red meat can drive your cancer.

00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:35,050
So if we think that red meat could be a driver of your cancer,

00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:38,050
we recommend that you don't eat red meat.

00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:41,050
Does it mean you could never eat red meat again?

00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:44,050
No, that does not mean that.

00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:49,050
So my personally, I believe when I tested myself,

00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:55,050
I felt like my mind was driven by meat.

00:00:55,050 --> 00:01:01,050
So I laid off of meat for some for fish for a long time.

00:01:01,050 --> 00:01:06,050
But now I'm eating green meat again and I'm not having any fishers.

00:01:06,050 --> 00:01:08,050
Is that the wisest thing to do?

00:01:08,050 --> 00:01:09,050
Well, I don't know.

00:01:09,050 --> 00:01:12,050
I'm praying about it and doing what I think is best.

00:01:12,050 --> 00:01:14,050
So.

